# Vendored jars for the Deephaven server image are placed here by
# scripts/build-image.sh. They include:
#   - deephaven-iceberg, deephaven-kafka extensions
#   - iceberg-aws-bundle, kafka-clients
#   - oms-protobuf-messages (built from :protobuf)
# All are excluded from version control by the global *.jar rule with an explicit
# !deephaven-server/extras/*.jar exception in the root .gitignore.
